  "name": "Pokémon Festa",
  "category": "event",
  "description": {
    "text": "Pokémon Festa was a touring summer celebration of Pokémon in Japan, where visitors played the video games and the card game, watched the films and joined stage events, and which in 2002, 2004 and 2005 shared its venues with the Battle Road Summer tournaments. Its cards were an orienteering prize in 2002, cards for visitors and Pokémon Daisuki Club members in 2004, and a jumbo Shadow Lugia with Pokémon Scoop in 2005.",
